As Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce &#8216;s wedding reportedly draws closer, George Kittle just revealed one rule the couple has set with guests.

Related

Taylor Swift Delivers Surprise &#8216;Love Story&#8217; Duet With Lainey Wilson & Flashes Engagement Ring at&nbsp;TEU

Here&#8217;s What Chiefs Coach Andy Reid Says He&#8217;s Getting Travis Kelce as a Wedding Gift: &#8216;He&#8217;ll Be as Happy as Can&nbsp;Be&#8217;

Here&#8217;s Everything We Know About Taylor Swift & Travis Kelce&#8217;s Wedding So&nbsp;Far

&#8220;They said absolutely no gifts,&#8221; the San Francisco 49ers player told ExtraTV at the Tight Ends & Friends concert on Tuesday (June 23).

That said, Kittle is still thinking about something small he can give to the Kansas City Chiefs tight end on his big day. &#8220;I was thinking &#8230; Travis for some reason likes old coins,&#8221; Kittle told the outlet. &#8220;So I might get him an old coin. Sounds expensive, too.&#8221;

Swift, Kelce and Kittle were all in the house on Tuesday night, coming together for this year&#8217;s Tight End University founded by the two football stars and Greg Olsen. The annual event aims to unite the NFL&#8217;s tight ends while raising money for charity, including through the Tight Ends & Friends concert.

This year, the concert took place at The Pinnacle in Nashville with featured performer Lainey Wilson, who at one point welcomed Swift on stage for a surprise &#8220;Love Story&#8221; duet.

&#8220;We have a special request by a very special tight end, who wanted to hear a particular song,&#8221; Swift said before diving into the track &#8212; which reached No. 4 on the Billboard Hot 100 in 2009 &#8212; with Wilson. &#8220;And that tight end is named George Kittle.&#8221;

The event comes ahead of Swift and Kelce&#8217;s nuptials, which will reportedly take place over Fourth of July weekend. Kittle seemed to confirm as much in a separate interview with People , saying, &#8220;She&#8217;s such an awesome person to give us her time this close to her wedding, so we&#8217;re just so thankful that they&#8217;re here.&#8221;

Someone else in Kelce&#8217;s life who&#8217;s weighed in on the topic of possible wedding gifts is Chiefs coach Andy Reid, who joked in a recent KSHB 41 interview, &#8220;I’m going to give Travis a couple throws — just a couple of new routes. He&#8217;ll be as happy as can be.&#8221;

Watch Kittle discuss Swift and Kelce&#8217;s wedding below.

George Kittle says Taylor Swift & Travis Kelce said “absolutely no gifts” for their wedding, but he has something in mind for Travis! 😊

